201
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,440
I actually feel kind of guilty.

202
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:07,640
He is a captain, after all.

203
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,820
It doesn't matter a win is a win.

204
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:12,040
We should face our foes with our full might

205
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,780
no matter how unthreatening they are.

206
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:14,420
Right.

207
