242
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,960
He's a monster!

243
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,920
He's a monster!

244
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,100
It's wrong.

245
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:11,220
Wrong, wrong, wrong, wrong, wrong, wrong.

246
00:11:16,060 --> 00:11:17,600
I hate this.

247
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:20,220
It isn't what I wanted to paint at all.

248
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:23,060
It should be more.

249
00:11:24,260 --> 00:11:24,820
More.

250
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,000
