253
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,060
Now I do wish.

254
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:37,200
I wish you'd never been born.

255
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:46,400
You don't understand my art, and you never will.

256
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,200
Never.

257
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:49,380
Ever.

258
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:57,340
Young master, may I have a word with you?

259
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,320
Shut up, Walter.

260
00:11:58,920 --> 00:11:59,520
Get out!

261
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:10,660
