266
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:26,720
Everybody leave me alone!

267
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:36,560
They have no idea how much I'm suffering.

268
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:40,060
Not Walter, not Mother, no one!

269
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,900
None of you understand me!

270
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:11,900
