281
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,340
You love to make art.

282
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,460
Don't you want someone else to see it as well?

283
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:54,000
Although a tiny canvas such as this cannot hope to contain your outstanding talent, young master,

284
00:13:54,380 --> 00:13:56,460
